
<p>This is a foundational Ansible Automation Platform (AAP) demo for illustrating the value of the platform extending the purview of automation beyond IT by scaling in-house skills and leveraging the strength of the Ansible Community.
It will serve as a baseline script for future demos covering additional AAP features.
Personalization and customization by Sales Speacialist Persons (SSPs) to suit individual account/opportunity needs is encouraged.</p>

