<h4>Main Components</h4>

<br>

<ul>
  <ul>
    <li>Automation controller with:</li>
    <ul>
      <li>Preloaded AWS credentials</li>
      <li>Preloaded Azure credentials</li>
      <li>Preloaded projects, job templates, and workflows</li>
      <li>Bastion host with SSH access</li>
    </ul>
  </ul>
</ul>

<br>

<p>Provisioning time: From 10 to 50 minutes depending on pool availability</p>

